<title>JAPAN: Hikari Tsushin rises on earnings forecast revision.</title>
<headline>Hikari Tsushin rises on earnings forecast revision.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Japanese telecommunication services firm Hikari Tsushin Inc rose on Wednesday morning because of the firm's upward revision of its business forecast, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0051 GMT, the shares stood at 7,400 yen in over-the-counter trade, up from the Tuesday close of 7,300 yen.</p>
